{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>An ancient civilization inherited a mysterious relic from the East, the most core of which is a golden mask that contains unknown power.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The chosen prophet and leader was supposed to use this relic to guide the civilization\u2019s course, but as the power awakened, their perception and abilities gradually transcended human understanding. The tribe regarded this supernatural gift as a miracle, and their excessive worship ultimately plunged the civilization into an unknown whirlpool of fate. Despite the guardian\u2019s efforts to save them, the ending remains shrouded in mystery. At a turning point in the civilization, the guardian buried the golden mask deep within the ancient ruins and left a prophecy:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;<strong>When the new dawn arrives, may this mask awaken sleeping wisdom, and choose the worthy to reignite the flame of civilization.</strong>&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731990/extras/\u8c03\u6162.gif?t=1749107751\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>This DLC includes:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New Mask: Golden Legend<br>New Skin: Rising Moon<br>New furniture: Sacred Bronze Tree and Mysterious Bronze Man</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731990/extras/\u7075\u9b42\u9762\u7532\u622a\u56fe28.jpg?t=1749107751\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731990/extras/\u7075\u9b42\u9762\u7532\u622a\u56fe29.jpg?t=1749107751\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731990/extras/\u7075\u9b42\u9762\u7532\u622a\u56fe22.jpg?t=1749107751\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3731990?t=1749